{"id": "141787", "name": "מציאת וקטור אורתוגונלי - ממשי+פולינום", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "vectToPoly", "params": ["vect"], "body": "block([poly:0], for i:0 thru (length(vect)-1) do(poly: poly + x^i*vect[i+1,1]),poly)"}, {"name": "polyToVect", "params": ["poly"], "body": "transpose(rest(coeff_list(x^n+poly,x),-1))"}, {"name": "realprod", "params": ["u", "v"], "body": "transpose(u).v"}, {"name": "polprod", "params": ["u", "v"], "body": "expand(integrate(u*v,x,-1,1))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>נתון ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span> הוקטור</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[v={{CT:0}}\\]</p><p>מצאו וקטור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\in\\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span> המאונך ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span> לפי המכפלה הפנימית הסטנדרטית.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(u=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>נתון ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}_{\\leq 1}[x]\\)</span> הפולינום</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p(x)={{CT:1}}\\]</p><p>מצאו פולינום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(q(x)\\in \\mathbb{R}_{\\leq 1}[x]\\)</span> המאונך ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p(x)\\)</span> לפי המכפלה הפנימית:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[(p,q) = \\int_{-1}^{1}p(x)\\cdot q(x) dx\\]</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(q=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "goodsize: is(length(ans1)=n and length(transpose(ans1))=1);\nans: if goodsize then ans1 else col(ident(n),1);\nansprod: realprod(realvect,ans);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodsize", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> הקלט שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\)</span> אינו וקטור עמודה מהאורך הנכון.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ansprod", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> תשובתך נכונה. הוקטור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\)</span> שהזנת אכן מאונך ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך אינה נכונה. הוקטור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\)</span> שהזנת אינו מאונך ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span>. למעשה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((v,u)={@ansprod@}\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varlist: listofvars(ans2);\ngoodvarlist: is(varlist=[] or varlist=[x]);\ngooddeg: is(hipow(ans2,x) <= 1);\nvalidInput: goodvarlist and gooddeg;\n\nansprod: polprod(polvect,ans2);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodvarlist", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> הקלט שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(q\\)</span> אינו תקין. נדרשת להזין פולינום לינארי במשתנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ansprod", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> תשובתך נכונה. הפולינום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(q\\)</span> שהזנת אכן מאונך ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך אינה נכונה. הפולינום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(q\\)</span> שהזנת אינו מאונך ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p\\)</span>. למעשה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((p,q)={@ansprod@}\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["k", "n", "perppolvect", "perprealvect", "polvect", "polvectcoords", "realvect"], "nvariants": 50}